config APP_COMPASS
    bool "Compass app"
    default y if MAG || QEMU
    help
      A compass dial driven by the compass data event. On a watch that event
      comes from the e-compass service and needs a magnetometer; under QEMU the
      emulator posts it directly, which is what makes the screen testable.
